k hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Кой гласува за тях</a></li><li><a href=\"#zakoni\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Закони</a></li><li><a href=\"#temi\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">По теми</a></li><li><a href=\"#saiuznici\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">С кого гласува</a></li><li><a href=\"#signali\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Дела и санкции</a></li><li><a href=\"#subsidiya\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Субсидия</a></li><li><a href=\"#deputati\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Депутати</a></li></ul></nav><section id=\"izbirateli\" class=\"mb-14 scroll-mt-32 lg:scroll-mt-20\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Къде са избирателите</h2></div><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted -mt-3 mb-4 max-w-3xl\">Делът на листата от гласовете за партии във всяка община. Посочи община, за да видиш числата.</p><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><div class=\"w-full min-h-[200px]\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Зареждане на картата…</p></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 mt-6\"><div><p class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Най-силни общини</p><ol class=\"text-[15px] space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Симитли</span><span class=\"num\">62,7<!-- -->% · <!-- -->5068</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Долна баня</span><span class=\"num\">51<!-- -->% · <!-- -->1270</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Любимец</span><span class=\